--- 2026-09-26T14:06:43Z method=一次資料 target=E5_eos_quote_v2 rc=0 time_s=0.005 note=8-031 E5の判定根拠を生ログに印字し直す(前手の行範囲が誤っていた): eos.adoc 17-20行目
$ sed -n 17,20p /tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-031/src/debezium/documentation/modules/ROOT/pages/configuration/eos.adoc
In certain scenarios, these duplicate records might be problematic, and exactly-once semantics may be required.

Exactly-once delivery ensures that every change is delivered and appears in the change stream no more than once.
This is a significantly stricter requirement than at-least-once delivery.
